Brig
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
BROCEZ 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
BROCEZ 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
BROCEZ 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

DOYU 3 FACE_HALF
DOYU 5 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE BROCEZ {BROCEZ, DOYU}
OR
    DEST Rank 1
    AND
        DEST Size <= 9
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
MOVE DOYU BROCEZ
OR
    DESTSRC Suit match_color
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank equal
        SRC Rank 1
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DOYU Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL BROCEZ Empty
        PILE ALL DOYU Empty
